  "fighter_help_title": "Fighter stats — help",
  "fighter_help_body": "[b][color=ff5050]ATK[/color][/b] — attack. Base damage dealt. Scales with STR, weapon, upgrades.\n\n[b][color=5090ff]DEF[/color][/b] — defense. Reduces incoming damage via def/(def+100).\n\n[b][color=50d050]HP[/color][/b] — current / max health. Scales with VIT, level, accessories.\n\n[b][color=ffd040]Crit[/color][/b] — chance of critical hit (×1.8+ damage). Scales with AGI.\n\n[b][color=40d0d0]Dodge[/color][/b] — chance to dodge an attack. Scales with AGI (diminishing).\n\n[b][color=ff5050]STR[/color][/b] — strength. +2 ATK per point.\n\n[b][color=50d050]AGI[/color][/b] — agility. Boosts crit, dodge and crit damage.\n\n[b][color=5090ff]VIT[/color][/b] — vitality. +1 DEF and +8 HP per point.\n\n[b][color=80ff80]Stamina[/color][/b] — 0–100. Drops by 10 per battle fought. Recovers +20 per battle skipped (while benched).\n\n[b][color=ffa040]Fatigue[/color][/b] — 0–100. Starts rising once stamina = 0 (+10 per battle). Reduces ALL combat stats by its % (fatigue 30 → -30% ATK/DEF/HP/crit/dodge). Recovers +20 per skipped battle BEFORE stamina.\n\n[b][color=ff4040]Exhausted[/color][/b] — at fatigue 100 the fighter is locked from battle. Bench them to recover.\n\n[b]Injuries[/b] — light auto-heal in 5 skipped battles, medium in 10, heavy in 15. Permanent never auto-heal.",
  "help_btn_close": "Close",
